# Git Integration
# Jenkins Pipeline - Checkout Git
You will learn how to **checkout a Git repository** and list files.

pipeline {
    agent any
    stages {
        stage('checkout') {
            steps {
                git branch: 'main', url: 'https://github.com/Pathnex/sample-java-app.git'
            }
        }
        stage('List Files') {
            steps {
                sh 'ls -la'
            }
        }
    }
}

# GitLab CI - Checkout Git
You will earn how to ** checkout a git repository in GitLab CI**.

stages:
  -checkout

git-checkout:
  stage: checkout
  script:
